msgid "Pending removal in Python 3.15"
msgstr "Python 3.15 で削除予定"

msgid ""
"The :c:func:`!PyImport_ImportModuleNoBlock`: Use :c:func:"
"`PyImport_ImportModule` instead."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`!PyImport_ImportModuleNoBlock`：代わりに :c:func:"
"`PyImport_ImportModule` を使ってください。"

msgid ""
":c:func:`!PyWeakref_GetObject` and :c:func:`!PyWeakref_GET_OBJECT`: Use :c:"
"func:`PyWeakref_GetRef` instead. The `pythoncapi-compat project <https://"
"github.com/python/pythoncapi-compat/>`__ can be used to get :c:func:"
"`PyWeakref_GetRef` on Python 3.12 and older."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`!PyWeakref_GetObject` と :c:func:`!PyWeakref_GET_OBJECT`：代わりに :"
"c:func:`PyWeakref_GetRef` を使ってください。\n"
"`pythoncapi-compat プロジェクト <https://github.com/python/pythoncapi-compat/"
">`__ を使うと、Python 3.12 以前でも :c:func:`PyWeakref_GetRef` を利用できま"
"す。"

msgid ""
":c:func:`!PyUnicode_AsDecodedObject`: Use :c:func:`PyCodec_Decode` instead."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`!PyUnicode_AsDecodedObject`：代わりに :c:func:`PyCodec_Decode` を"
"使ってください。"

msgid ""
":c:func:`!PyUnicode_AsDecodedUnicode`: Use :c:func:`PyCodec_Decode` instead; "
"Note that some codecs (for example, \"base64\") may return a type other "
"than :class:`str`, such as :class:`bytes`."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`!PyUnicode_AsDecodedUnicode`：代わりに :c:func:`PyCodec_Decode` を"
"使ってください。\n"
"一部のコーデック (例えば \"base64\") は、:class:`bytes` など :class:`str` 以"
"外の型を返す場合があることに注意してください。"

msgid ""
":c:func:`!PyUnicode_AsEncodedObject`: Use :c:func:`PyCodec_Encode` instead."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`!PyUnicode_AsEncodedObject`：代わりに :c:func:`PyCodec_Encode` を"
"使ってください。"

#: ../../deprecations/c-api-pending-removal-in-3.15.rst:17
msgid ""
":c:func:`!PyUnicode_AsEncodedUnicode`: Use :c:func:`PyCodec_Encode` instead; "
"Note that some codecs (for example, \"base64\") may return a type other "
"than :class:`bytes`, such as :class:`str`."
msgstr ""

msgid "Python initialization functions, deprecated in Python 3.13:"
msgstr "Python 3.13 で非推奨となった Python 初期化関数："

msgid ""
":c:func:`!Py_GetPath`: Use :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"module_search_paths\") "
"<PyConfig_Get>` (:data:`sys.path`) instead."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`!Py_GetPath`：代わりに :c:func:"
"`PyConfig_Get(\"module_search_paths\") <PyConfig_Get>` (:data:`sys.path`) を"
"使ってください。"

msgid ""
":c:func:`!Py_GetPrefix`: Use :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"base_prefix\") "
"<PyConfig_Get>` (:data:`sys.base_prefix`) instead. Use :c:func:"
"`PyConfig_Get(\"prefix\") <PyConfig_Get>` (:data:`sys.prefix`) if :ref:"
"`virtual environments <venv-def>` need to be handled."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`!Py_GetPrefix`：代わりに :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"base_prefix\") "
"<PyConfig_Get>` (:data:`sys.base_prefix`) を使ってください。\n"
":ref:`仮想環境 <venv-def>` に対応する必要がある場合は、:c:func:"
"`PyConfig_Get(\"prefix\") <PyConfig_Get>` (:data:`sys.prefix`) を使ってくださ"
"い。"

msgid ""
":c:func:`!Py_GetExecPrefix`: Use :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"base_exec_prefix\") "
"<PyConfig_Get>` (:data:`sys.base_exec_prefix`) instead. Use :c:func:"
"`PyConfig_Get(\"exec_prefix\") <PyConfig_Get>` (:data:`sys.exec_prefix`) if :"
"ref:`virtual environments <venv-def>` need to be handled."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`!Py_GetExecPrefix`：代わりに :c:func:"
"`PyConfig_Get(\"base_exec_prefix\") <PyConfig_Get>` (:data:`sys."
"base_exec_prefix`) を使ってください。\n"
":ref:`仮想環境 <venv-def>` に対応する必要がある場合は、:c:func:"
"`PyConfig_Get(\"exec_prefix\") <PyConfig_Get>` (:data:`sys.exec_prefix`) を"
"使ってください。"

msgid ""
":c:func:`!Py_GetProgramFullPath`: Use :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"executable\") "
"<PyConfig_Get>` (:data:`sys.executable`) instead."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`!Py_GetProgramFullPath`：代わりに :c:func:"
"`PyConfig_Get(\"executable\") <PyConfig_Get>` (:data:`sys.executable`) を使っ"
"てください。"

msgid ""
":c:func:`!Py_GetProgramName`: Use :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"executable\") "
"<PyConfig_Get>` (:data:`sys.executable`) instead."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`!Py_GetProgramName`：代わりに :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"executable\") "
"<PyConfig_Get>` (:data:`sys.executable`) を使ってください。"

msgid ""
":c:func:`!Py_GetPythonHome`: Use :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"home\") "
"<PyConfig_Get>` or the :envvar:`PYTHONHOME` environment variable instead."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`!Py_GetPythonHome`：代わりに :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"home\") "
"<PyConfig_Get>` または環境変数 :envvar:`PYTHONHOME` を使ってください。"

msgid ""
"The `pythoncapi-compat project <https://github.com/python/pythoncapi-compat/"
">`__ can be used to get :c:func:`PyConfig_Get` on Python 3.13 and older."
msgstr ""
"`pythoncapi-compat プロジェクト <https://github.com/python/pythoncapi-compat/"
">`__ を使うと、Python 3.13 以前でも :c:func:`PyConfig_Get` を利用できます。"

msgid ""
"Functions to configure Python's initialization, deprecated in Python 3.11:"
msgstr "Python 3.11 で非推奨となった、Python の初期化を設定する関数："

msgid ":c:func:`!PySys_SetArgvEx()`: Set :c:member:`PyConfig.argv` instead."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`!PySys_SetArgvEx()`：代わりに :c:member:`PyConfig.argv` を設定してく"
"ださい。"

msgid ":c:func:`!PySys_SetArgv()`: Set :c:member:`PyConfig.argv` instead."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`!PySys_SetArgv()`：代わりに :c:member:`PyConfig.argv` を設定してくだ"
"さい。"

msgid ""
":c:func:`!Py_SetProgramName()`: Set :c:member:`PyConfig.program_name` "
"instead."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`!Py_SetProgramName()`：代わりに :c:member:`PyConfig.program_name` を"
"設定してください。"

msgid ":c:func:`!Py_SetPythonHome()`: Set :c:member:`PyConfig.home` instead."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`!Py_SetPythonHome()`：代わりに :c:member:`PyConfig.home` を設定して"
"ください。"

msgid ""
":c:func:`!PySys_ResetWarnOptions`: Clear :data:`sys.warnoptions` and :data:`!"
"warnings.filters` instead."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`!PySys_ResetWarnOptions`：代わりに :data:`sys.warnoptions` と :data:"
"`!warnings.filters` をクリアしてください。"

msgid ""
"The :c:func:`Py_InitializeFromConfig` API should be used with :c:type:"
"`PyConfig` instead."
msgstr ""
"代わりに :c:type:`PyConfig` と :c:func:`Py_InitializeFromConfig` API を使って"
"ください。"

msgid "Global configuration variables:"
msgstr "グローバルな設定変数："

msgid ""
":c:var:`Py_DebugFlag`: Use :c:member:`PyConfig.parser_debug` or :c:func:"
"`PyConfig_Get(\"parser_debug\") <PyConfig_Get>` instead."
msgstr ""
":c:var:`Py_DebugFlag`：代わりに :c:member:`PyConfig.parser_debug` または :c:"
"func:`PyConfig_Get(\"parser_debug\") <PyConfig_Get>` を使ってください。"

msgid ""
":c:var:`Py_VerboseFlag`: Use :c:member:`PyConfig.verbose` or :c:func:"
"`PyConfig_Get(\"verbose\") <PyConfig_Get>` instead."
msgstr ""
":c:var:`Py_VerboseFlag`：代わりに :c:member:`PyConfig.verbose` または :c:"
"func:`PyConfig_Get(\"verbose\") <PyConfig_Get>` を使ってください。"

msgid ""
":c:var:`Py_QuietFlag`: Use :c:member:`PyConfig.quiet` or :c:func:"
"`PyConfig_Get(\"quiet\") <PyConfig_Get>` instead."
msgstr ""
":c:var:`Py_QuietFlag`：代わりに :c:member:`PyConfig.quiet` または :c:func:"
"`PyConfig_Get(\"quiet\") <PyConfig_Get>` を使ってください。"

msgid ""
":c:var:`Py_InteractiveFlag`: Use :c:member:`PyConfig.interactive` or :c:func:"
"`PyConfig_Get(\"interactive\") <PyConfig_Get>` instead."
msgstr ""
":c:var:`Py_InteractiveFlag`：代わりに :c:member:`PyConfig.interactive` また"
"は :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"interactive\") <PyConfig_Get>` を使ってください。"

msgid ""
":c:var:`Py_InspectFlag`: Use :c:member:`PyConfig.inspect` or :c:func:"
"`PyConfig_Get(\"inspect\") <PyConfig_Get>` instead."
msgstr ""
":c:var:`Py_InspectFlag`：代わりに :c:member:`PyConfig.inspect` または :c:"
"func:`PyConfig_Get(\"inspect\") <PyConfig_Get>` を使ってください。"

msgid ""
":c:var:`Py_OptimizeFlag`: Use :c:member:`PyConfig.optimization_level` or :c:"
"func:`PyConfig_Get(\"optimization_level\") <PyConfig_Get>` instead."
msgstr ""
":c:var:`Py_OptimizeFlag`：代わりに :c:member:`PyConfig.optimization_level` ま"
"たは :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"optimization_level\") <PyConfig_Get>` を使ってく"
"ださい。"

msgid ""
":c:var:`Py_NoSiteFlag`: Use :c:member:`PyConfig.site_import` or :c:func:"
"`PyConfig_Get(\"site_import\") <PyConfig_Get>` instead."
msgstr ""
":c:var:`Py_NoSiteFlag`：代わりに :c:member:`PyConfig.site_import` または :c:"
"func:`PyConfig_Get(\"site_import\") <PyConfig_Get>` を使ってください。"

msgid ""
":c:var:`Py_BytesWarningFlag`: Use :c:member:`PyConfig.bytes_warning` or :c:"
"func:`PyConfig_Get(\"bytes_warning\") <PyConfig_Get>` instead."
msgstr ""
":c:var:`Py_BytesWarningFlag`：代わりに :c:member:`PyConfig.bytes_warning` ま"
"たは :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"bytes_warning\") <PyConfig_Get>` を使ってくださ"
"い。"

msgid ""
":c:var:`Py_FrozenFlag`: Use :c:member:`PyConfig.pathconfig_warnings` or :c:"
"func:`PyConfig_Get(\"pathconfig_warnings\") <PyConfig_Get>` instead."
msgstr ""
":c:var:`Py_FrozenFlag`：代わりに :c:member:`PyConfig.pathconfig_warnings` ま"
"たは :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"pathconfig_warnings\") <PyConfig_Get>` を使って"
"ください。"

msgid ""
":c:var:`Py_IgnoreEnvironmentFlag`: Use :c:member:`PyConfig.use_environment` "
"or :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"use_environment\") <PyConfig_Get>` instead."
msgstr ""
":c:var:`Py_IgnoreEnvironmentFlag`：代わりに :c:member:`PyConfig."
"use_environment` または :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"use_environment\") "
"<PyConfig_Get>` を使ってください。"

msgid ""
":c:var:`Py_DontWriteBytecodeFlag`: Use :c:member:`PyConfig.write_bytecode` "
"or :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"write_bytecode\") <PyConfig_Get>` instead."
msgstr ""
":c:var:`Py_DontWriteBytecodeFlag`：代わりに :c:member:`PyConfig."
"write_bytecode` または :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"write_bytecode\") "
"<PyConfig_Get>` を使ってください。"

msgid ""
":c:var:`Py_NoUserSiteDirectory`: Use :c:member:`PyConfig."
"user_site_directory` or :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"user_site_directory\") "
"<PyConfig_Get>` instead."
msgstr ""
":c:var:`Py_NoUserSiteDirectory`：代わりに :c:member:`PyConfig."
"user_site_directory` または :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"user_site_directory\") "
"<PyConfig_Get>` を使ってください。"

msgid ""
":c:var:`Py_UnbufferedStdioFlag`: Use :c:member:`PyConfig.buffered_stdio` or :"
"c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"buffered_stdio\") <PyConfig_Get>` instead."
msgstr ""
":c:var:`Py_UnbufferedStdioFlag`：代わりに :c:member:`PyConfig."
"buffered_stdio` または :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"buffered_stdio\") "
"<PyConfig_Get>` を使ってください。"

msgid ""
":c:var:`Py_HashRandomizationFlag`: Use :c:member:`PyConfig.use_hash_seed` "
"and :c:member:`PyConfig.hash_seed` or :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"hash_seed\") "
"<PyConfig_Get>` instead."
msgstr ""
":c:var:`Py_HashRandomizationFlag`：代わりに :c:member:`PyConfig."
"use_hash_seed` と :c:member:`PyConfig.hash_seed` または :c:func:"
"`PyConfig_Get(\"hash_seed\") <PyConfig_Get>` を使ってください。"

msgid ""
":c:var:`Py_IsolatedFlag`: Use :c:member:`PyConfig.isolated` or :c:func:"
"`PyConfig_Get(\"isolated\") <PyConfig_Get>` instead."
msgstr ""
":c:var:`Py_IsolatedFlag`：代わりに :c:member:`PyConfig.isolated` または :c:"
"func:`PyConfig_Get(\"isolated\") <PyConfig_Get>` を使ってください。"

msgid ""
":c:var:`Py_LegacyWindowsFSEncodingFlag`: Use :c:member:`PyPreConfig."
"legacy_windows_fs_encoding` or :c:func:"
"`PyConfig_Get(\"legacy_windows_fs_encoding\") <PyConfig_Get>` instead."
msgstr ""
":c:var:`Py_LegacyWindowsFSEncodingFlag`：代わりに :c:member:`PyPreConfig."
"legacy_windows_fs_encoding` または :c:func:"
"`PyConfig_Get(\"legacy_windows_fs_encoding\") <PyConfig_Get>` を使ってくださ"
"い。"

msgid ""
":c:var:`Py_LegacyWindowsStdioFlag`: Use :c:member:`PyConfig."
"legacy_windows_stdio` or :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"legacy_windows_stdio\") "
"<PyConfig_Get>` instead."
msgstr ""
":c:var:`Py_LegacyWindowsStdioFlag`：代わりに :c:member:`PyConfig."
"legacy_windows_stdio` または :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"legacy_windows_stdio\") "
"<PyConfig_Get>` を使ってください。"

msgid ""
":c:var:`!Py_FileSystemDefaultEncoding`, :c:var:`!"
"Py_HasFileSystemDefaultEncoding`: Use :c:member:`PyConfig."
"filesystem_encoding` or :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"filesystem_encoding\") "
"<PyConfig_Get>` instead."
msgstr ""
":c:var:`!Py_FileSystemDefaultEncoding`、:c:var:`!"
"Py_HasFileSystemDefaultEncoding`：代わりに :c:member:`PyConfig."
"filesystem_encoding` または :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"filesystem_encoding\") "
"<PyConfig_Get>` を使ってください。"

msgid ""
":c:var:`!Py_FileSystemDefaultEncodeErrors`: Use :c:member:`PyConfig."
"filesystem_errors` or :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"filesystem_errors\") "
"<PyConfig_Get>` instead."
msgstr ""
":c:var:`!Py_FileSystemDefaultEncodeErrors`：代わりに :c:member:`PyConfig."
"filesystem_errors` または :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"filesystem_errors\") "
"<PyConfig_Get>` を使ってください。"

msgid ""
":c:var:`!Py_UTF8Mode`: Use :c:member:`PyPreConfig.utf8_mode` or :c:func:"
"`PyConfig_Get(\"utf8_mode\") <PyConfig_Get>` instead. (see :c:func:"
"`Py_PreInitialize`)"
msgstr ""
":c:var:`!Py_UTF8Mode`：代わりに :c:member:`PyPreConfig.utf8_mode` または :c:"
"func:`PyConfig_Get(\"utf8_mode\") <PyConfig_Get>` を使ってください。\n"
"(:c:func:`Py_PreInitialize` を参照)"

msgid ""
"The :c:func:`Py_InitializeFromConfig` API should be used with :c:type:"
"`PyConfig` to set these options. Or :c:func:`PyConfig_Get` can be used to "
"get these options at runtime."
msgstr ""
"これらのオプションを設定するには、:c:type:`PyConfig` と :c:func:"
"`Py_InitializeFromConfig` API を使ってください。\n"
"実行時に値を取得するには :c:func:`PyConfig_Get` を使えます。"
